OL,3,CHeat health alerts coming into force
OL,4,Cas UK braces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FHeat health alerts are to come into
OL,7,Fforce as the UK braces for the fifth
OL,8,Fheatwave of the year, with almost
OL,9,Fthree-quarters of England in drought.
OL,11,FOn Tuesday, highs of 29C in Cardiff,
OL,12,F28C in Manchester and 25C in London
OL,13,Fare forecast before temperatures soar
OL,14,Fto the mid-30s in some areas on
OL,15,FThursday, according to the Met Office.
OL,17,FFrom 9am on Tuesday, heat health
OL,18,Falerts issued by the UK Health
OL,19,FSecurity Agency (UKHSA) are in place
OL,20,Facross England until Friday evening.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
