OL,3,CHeat health alerts coming into force
OL,4,Cas UK braces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FOfficials have urged people to take
OL,7,Fsimple steps to stay safe, such as
OL,8,Fdrinking plenty of water, checking on
OL,9,Fvulnerable friends and family, and
OL,10,Favoiding the sun at the hottest part
OL,11,Fof the day.
OL,13,FAmber heat health alerts have been
OL,14,Fissued for most of England including
OL,15,Fthe Midlands, South East, North West
OL,16,Fand South West, while a yellow alert
OL,17,Fwill be in force for the North East.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
