OL,3,CHeat health alerts coming into force
OL,4,Cas UK braces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) said 71.3%
OL,7,Fof England is experiencing "flash
OL,8,Fdrought", as a dry start to August
OL,9,Ffollowed the country's driest July on
OL,10,Frecord.
OL,12,FFlash drought is one which develops
OL,13,Fvery quickly because of a combination
OL,14,Fof very low rainfall and high
OL,15,Ftemperatures.
OL,26,@oD@\OUpD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
