OL,3,CHeat health alerts coming into force
OL,4,Cas UK braces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FIn Monday's announcement, the agency
OL,7,Fsaid the East Midlands, Lincolnshire
OL,8,Fand Northamptonshire, Kent and East
OL,9,FSussex, and Solent and the South Downs
OL,10,Fhave become the latest areas to move
OL,11,Finto drought.
OL,13,FFirefighters have been battling a
OL,14,Fseries of fires across the UK,
OL,15,Fincluding one in the New Forest
OL,16,FNational Park, Hampshire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
