SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786434481
OL,3,CHeat health alerts coming into force
OL,4,Cas UK braces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FThe area hit by the blaze, which
OL,7,Fstarted after a van caught fire on the
OL,8,Fnearby A31 near Ringwood on Sunday, is
OL,9,Fprotected heathland and home to a
OL,10,Fnumber of rare species, according to
OL,11,Fthe New Forest National Park Authority.
OL,13,FOn Monday evening, Hampshire Fire and
OL,14,FRescue Service said crews were "set to
OL,15,Fwork into the night again" as more
OL,16,Fthan 120 firefighters attended the
OL,17,Fscene.
