OL,3,CHeat health alerts coming into force
OL,4,Cas UK braces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid on Monday night that crews were
OL,8,Fattending "multiple wildfire
OL,9,Fincidents", including at Cwmavon Woods
OL,10,Fin Blaenavon, Wattsville in Sirhowy
OL,11,FValley and Abernant in Aberdare.
OL,13,FThis week, parts of the UK are
OL,14,Fexpected to swelter in the fifth
OL,15,Fheatwave of the year with temperatures
OL,16,Fforecast to peak at 36C on Thursday,
OL,17,Faccording to the Met Office.
OL,26,@pD@KOUqD@JO]
