CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786434481
OL,3,CHeat health alerts coming into force
OL,4,Cas UK braces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FThe latest heatwave, which is expected
OL,7,Fto be widespread throughout England
OL,8,Fand Wales, is set to subside over the
OL,9,Fweekend and bring fresher air and
OL,10,Frain, but this is not expected to make
OL,11,Fup for the shortfall in recent months,
OL,12,Fforecasters warn.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
